{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05871","headline":"别綦毋潜 · 王维","name":"别綦毋潜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端笏明光宫，历稔朝云陛。\n诏刊延阁书，高议平津邸。\n适意偶轻人，虚心削繁礼。\n盛得江左风，弥工建安体。\n高张多绝弦，截河有清济。\n严冬爽羣木，伊洛方清泚。\n渭水冰下流，潼关雪中啓。\n荷蓧几时还，尘缨待君洗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}